  "claim": "The university team with the fight song The Minnesota State Rouser has a mascot called Stomper. It began competing in the same athletic conference as the St. Cloud State Huskies in 2008.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Stomper the Maverick. Sentence: Stomper the Maverick is the mascot for the Minnesota State Mavericks athletics teams of the Minnesota State University, Mankato and the associated club teams and charities.\nPage: Minnesota State Mavericks. Sentence: Minnesota State began competition in the NSIC in 2008-09, due to the dissolution of the North Central Conference.\nPage: The Minnesota State Rouser. Sentence: It is played at all Minnesota State Mavericks athletics games, rallies and at many alumni events.\nPage: St. Cloud State Huskies. Sentence: The university is primarily a member of the Northern Sun Intercollegiate Conference (NSIC), and currently sponsors 18 NCAA Division II teams.",
