        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Minnesota State University, Mankato; Minnesota State Mavericks; St. Cloud State Huskies; Northern Sun Intercollegiate Conference; North Central Conference\n- People/Roles: Stomper the Maverick\n- Products: The Minnesota State Rouser\n- Topics: athletics mascots; college athletics conferences\n\nFacts:\n- Minnesota State Mavericks began competition in the Northern Sun Intercollegiate Conference in 2008–09 because the North Central Conference dissolved.\n- Stomper the Maverick is the mascot for the Minnesota State Mavericks athletics teams of Minnesota State University, Mankato, as well as associated club teams and charities.\n- The Minnesota State Rouser is played at all Minnesota State Mavericks athletics games, rallies, and many alumni events.\n- St. Cloud State Huskies is primarily a member of the Northern Sun Intercollegiate Conference and currently sponsors 18 NCAA Division II teams.",
